system (for behind-screen speakers), and installation by certified Brightluxx engineers. Designed for custom integrators and luxury home builders who want a single-vendor cinema solution. ISF Level III calibration included.\", \"sku\": \"BL-HC-TPC\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\", \"category\": \"home-cinema\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_theaterpro-complete.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the TheaterPro Complete System different from standard home cinema screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The TheaterPro system is a turnkey solution including CinemaLED Pro 1.5mm pixel pitch screen, a dedicated 4K HDR processor, ISF Level III calibration, and acoustic-transparent mounts, offering a premium, integrated home theater experience unlike standalone screens.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the system be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, TheaterPro comes in standard sizes of 100\\\", 120\\\", and 150\\\", with options for custom sizes to perfectly fit your home theater dimensions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the on-site warranty cover and for how long?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The system includes a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty providing coverage for display components, processor functionality, and installation, ensuring peace of mind and prompt service.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is installation handled for this system?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is fully included and performed by certified Brightluxx engineers, ensuring professional setup, calibration, and integration with your home environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does TheaterPro compare to projector-based home cinema solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"TheaterPro offers superior image brightness (800 nits), perfect blacks, and no projector bulb replacements. Its acoustic-transparent screen allows for speaker placement behind the display, enhancing sound quality and overall experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the audio mounting system compatible with existing home theater speakers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the acoustic transparent audio mount is designed to support behind-screen speakers, integrating seamlessly with most high-end home theater audio setups.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is involved in the ISF Level III calibration service included with the system?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The ISF Level III calibration ensures accurate color reproduction and optimal picture quality, adjusted specifically for your room lighting and screen, performed by expert calibrators.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What type of content formats does the 4K HDR dedicated processor support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The processor supports native 4K HDR content playback, ensuring compatibility with the latest streaming services, 4K Blu-ray players, and gaming consoles, delivering vivid and lifelike visuals.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"TheaterPro Complete System\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>TheaterPro Complete System</h1><p>Experience the ultimate TheaterPro Complete LED system in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom LED solutions. Get a quote today!</p><p><strong>Turnkey home cinema: screen, processor, calibration included.</strong></p><p>TheaterPro is a complete home cinema solution — not just a screen. Includes the CinemaLED Pro display, a dedicated 4K HDR video processor, color calibration service, acoustic-transparent mounting system (for behind-screen speakers), and installation by certified Brightluxx engineers. Designed for custom integrators and luxury home builders who want a single-vendor cinema solution. ISF Level III calibration included.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the TheaterPro Complete System different from standard home cinema screens?</h3><p>The TheaterPro system is a turnkey solution including CinemaLED Pro 1.5mm pixel pitch screen, a dedicated 4K HDR processor, ISF Level III calibration, and acoustic-transparent mounts, offering a premium, integrated home theater experience unlike standalone screens.</p><h3>Can the system be customized for different room sizes?</h3><p>Yes, TheaterPro comes in standard sizes of 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, with options for custom sizes to perfectly fit your home theater dimensions.</p><h3>What does the on-site warranty cover and for how long?</h3><p>The system includes a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty providing coverage for display components, processor functionality, and installation, ensuring peace of mind and prompt service.</p><h3>How is installation handled for this system?</h3><p>Installation is fully included and performed by certified Brightluxx engineers, ensuring professional setup, calibration, and integration with your home environment.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"theaterpro-complete\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/theaterpro-complete\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precede