n the system be customized for different room sizes?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, TheaterPro comes in standard sizes of 100\\u0026quot;, 120\\u0026quot;, and 150\\u0026quot;, with options for custom sizes to perfectly fit your home theater dimensions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat does the on-site warranty cover and for how long?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe system includes a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty providing coverage for display components, processor functionality, and installation, ensuring peace of mind and prompt service.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is installation handled for this system?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallation is fully included and performed by certified Brightluxx engineers, ensuring professional setup, calibration, and integration with your home environment.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"TheaterPro Complete System | Premium LED Displays Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Experience the ultimate TheaterPro Complete LED system in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom LED solutions. Get a quote today!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundar