ema solution. ISF Level III calibration included.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the TheaterPro Complete System different from standard home cinema screens?</h3><p>The TheaterPro system is a turnkey solution including CinemaLED Pro 1.5mm pixel pitch screen, a dedicated 4K HDR processor, ISF Level III calibration, and acoustic-transparent mounts, offering a premium, integrated home theater experience unlike standalone screens.</p><h3>Can the system be customized for different room sizes?</h3><p>Yes, TheaterPro comes in standard sizes of 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, with options for custom sizes to perfectly fit your home theater dimensions.</p><h3>What does the on-site warranty cover and for how long?</h3><p>The system includes a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty providing coverage for display components, processor functionality, and installation, ensuring peace of mind and prompt service.</p><h3>How is installation handled for this system?</h3><p>Installation is fully included and performed by certified Brightluxx engineers, ensuring professional setup, calibration, and integration with your home environment.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TheaterPro Complete System | Premium LED Displays Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Experience the ultimate TheaterPro Complete LED system in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom LED solutions. Get a quote today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T642,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"TheaterPro Complete System\", \"description\": \"TheaterPro is a complet