ndroid-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T6ea,<h1>TheaterPro Complete System</h1><p>Experience the ultimate TheaterPro Complete LED system in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom LED solutions. Get a quote today!</p><p><strong>Turnkey home cinema: screen, processor, calibration included.</strong></p><p>TheaterPro is a complete home cinema solution — not just a screen. Includes the CinemaLED Pro display, a dedicated 4K HDR video processor, color calibration service, acoustic-transparent mounting system (for behind-screen speakers), and installation by certified Brightluxx engineers. Designed for custom integrators and luxury home builders who want a single-vendor cinema solution. ISF Level III calibration included.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the TheaterPro Complete System different from standard home cinema screens?</h3><p>The TheaterPro system is a turnkey solution including CinemaLED Pro 1.5mm pixel pitch screen, a dedicated 4K HDR processor, ISF Level III calibration, and acoustic-transparent mounts, offering a premium, integrated home theater experience unlike standalone screens.</p><h3>Can the system be customized for different room sizes?</h3><p>Yes, TheaterPro comes in standard sizes of 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot;, with options for custom sizes to perfectly fit your home theater dimensions.</p><h3>What does the on-site warranty cover and for how long?</h3><p>The system includes a comprehensive 5-year on-site warranty providing coverage for display components, processor functionality, and installation, ensuring peace of mind and prompt service.</p><h3>How is installation handled for this system?</h3><p>Installation is fully included and performed by certified Brightluxx engineers, ensuring professional setup, calibration, and integration with your home environment.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"TheaterPro Complete System | Premium LED Displays Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Experience the ultimate TheaterPro Complete LED system in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE offers custom LED solutions. Get a quote today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/theaterpro-complete\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"prece